<title>ISRAEL: Two Israeli commandos disappear while training.</title>
<headline>Two Israeli commandos disappear while training.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Israeli navy commandos disappeared in Haifa bay while on a diving training exercise, the Israeli army said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said contact with the two was lost during the night. Searches initiated immediately were continuing on Thursday.</p>
<p>Haifa is a northern Israeli port on the Mediterranean.</p>
</text>
